<title>POLAND: Polish PEPEES to start bourse trade on May 22.</title>
<headline>Polish PEPEES to start bourse trade on May 22.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer PEPEES SA will start trade on the main market of the Warsaw bourse on May 22, the bourse said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The firm, whose public offering of 152,100 existing shares at a minimum price of 100 zlotys took place last week, has the shares allotted at a special bourse session later on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
